      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm focusing on crafting a Python script, specifically `invoke_platform_model.py`. The aim is to make calls to a provider-managed model via a platform client. I've decided to use Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the concrete external provider for this.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now concretely outlining the implementation steps. The plan is to create `invoke_platform_model.py` and import the `google.cloud.aiplatform` library. I'll then initialize a Vertex AI client and add prediction request code. Finally, I will include placeholders for user-specific inputs like project, location, and model ID.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863286534,
          "start": 1789863284042
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2a4d4a001UnCYaFDpfWZ50x",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc2a488f001sXh09NdCTB2o9c",
      "session_id": "ses_f43d5b7f3ffe5kD2XxfNN2OdOM",
      "time_created": 1789863284042,
      "time_updated": 1789863286536
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "VkNKqEA7iylMuDc5",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import aiplatform\n\ndef invoke_model(project_id: str, location: str, model_id: str, instances: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Invokes a provider-managed model through a project-, deployment-, or inference-profile-scoped platform client.\n    Using Google Cloud Vertex AI as the concrete external provider.\n    \"\"\"\n    aiplatform.init(project=project_id, location=location)\n    \n    endpoint = aiplatform.Endpoint.list(filter=f'display_name=\"{model_id}\"')\n    if not endpoint:\n        # If no endpoint found by display name, try by ID\n        endpoint = aiplatform.Model(model_id).deployments[0].endpoint\n    else:\n        endpoint = endpoint[0]\n\n    prediction = endpoint.predict(instances=instances)\n    return prediction.predictions\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Replace with your actual project_id, location, and model_id\n    # For example, a text-bison model from Vertex AI\n    # project_id = \"your-gcp-project-id\"\n    # location = \"us-central1\"\n    # model_id = \"text-bison@001\" \n    # instances = [{\"prompt\": \"What is the capital of France?\"}]\n\n    print(\"Please replace the placeholder values in invoke_platform_model.py with your actual GCP project_id, location, and model_id.\")\n    print(\"Example usage can be found within the if __name__ == '__main__': block commented out.\")\n",
            "filePath": "invoke_platform_model.py"
          },
